  data: {
    LLM: 'Keep hold of your Sevens if you have cards at the extreme ends of that suit (Aces or 2s). By not playing the 7, you block everyone else from playing in that suit.\n\nBlock and Release: If you have both the 6 and 8 of a suit, you control the expansion. You can hold them to prevent others from playing their 5s and 9s.\n\nWatch the Discards: In variants where you pay a chip for passing, force your opponents to pass by withholding the midndrange cards (6s and 8s) for as long as possible.',
    Player: 'Keep hold of your Sevens if you have cards at the extreme ends of that suit (Aces or 2s). By not playing the 7, you block everyone else from playing in that suit.\n\nBlock and Release: If you have both the 6 and 8 of a suit, you control the expansion. You can hold them to prevent others from playing their 5s and 9s.\n\nWatch the Discards: In variants where you pay a chip for passing, force your opponents to pass by withholding the midndrange cards (6s and 8s) for as long as possible.',
